fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"coretracers/leaks.html#GstLeaksTracer::activity-stop-tracking","fragment":"\n\tactivity-stop-tracking\n\nStop tracking all objects that are being created or removed, undoes the\neffects of the start-tracking signal.\nParameters:\nthe leaks tracer object to emit this signal on\n\n\tFlags:\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRun Last\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tAction\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\n"});